@page "/event/import"
@layout SidebarLayout

<PageTitle>Event - Import Screen</PageTitle>

<ilw-content>
    <h1>Import Screen</h1>
</ilw-content>


<p>To get an ICS file through Outlook, go to Settings --> Calendar, then choose <em>Shared Calendars</em>. Choose the calendar, choose Share All Details, and then click the Publish button.</p>
<p>You will have an .ICS file published.</p>

<button class="ilw-button" @onclick="ImportEvents">Import Events</button>

<p>@Output</p>
